            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLESH &amp; BONE</strong> is the most <strong>BRUTAL</strong>, <strong>90s SURVIVAL</strong> arena with exactly <strong>ZERO</strong> hand holding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chose your play style and combine 3 vastly different strategies: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND OF BONE</strong> to wield <strong>NECROMAGIC</strong> for range combat and hijacking enemy brains into  your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/extras/c97c43b2a7716652415d62001f60a02e.poster.avif?t=1789751883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/extras/c97c43b2a7716652415d62001f60a02e.webm?t=1789751883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/extras/c97c43b2a7716652415d62001f60a02e.mp4?t=1789751883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND OF FLESH</strong> to wield <strong>TECHNOMANCY</strong> for acrobatic melee combat and turret defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/extras/d72d71a25c0d78ab219696a514542e63.poster.avif?t=1789751883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/extras/d72d71a25c0d78ab219696a514542e63.webm?t=1789751883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323080/extras/d72d71a25c0d78ab219696a514542e63.mp4?t=1789751883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or combine both. </p><